<final>


The contract contains a critical vulnerability where asset transfers are sent to an unvalidated receiver address specified in the transaction accounts array.

### Vulnerability: Unchecked Asset Receiver
### Explanation: The contract fails to validate the asset receiver address, allowing any address specified in Txn.accounts[1] to receive transferred assets without authorization checks, potentially enabling unauthorized asset drainage.
### Risk: Critical - Allows complete drainage of assets held by the contract to any address specified by an attacker.
